WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
An In progress order can remain Unpaid: fulfilment and payment are independent.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Payment status offers Unpaid, Paid, and Refunded. Refunded orders are excluded from report sales.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
A completed order retains its payment status, item details, totals, and returns section.

